WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.875
forever runs its blocks again and again.

2
00:00:03.852 --> 00:00:08.227
After the last block, it starts again from the top. That is a loop.

3
00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:16.083
pause keeps a picture on for longer. A thousand milliseconds is one second.

4
00:00:16.913 --> 00:00:19.688
Then the loop carries on with the next picture.
